            "SamplePreparationMethod/MethodDescriptionText": "Dump contents of composite bucket (current and slack water samples) into 0.3-m diameter 500-um mesh sieve; wash sample gently (no nozzle) using onboard washdown hose. Gravel, large organic particles, and macrophytes should be thoroughly washed, inspected for clinging organisms and discarded. Transfer washed composite sample to 500-mL jar using wide-bore funnel; wash bottle w/ minimal water. Fill jar 1/3 full; top w/10% carbonate-buffered formalin (pH10) and concentrated rose bengal solution.",
